DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1635328@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerWorld-renowned filmmaker and p
 rofessional skier Chris Benchetler brings his immersive film Mountains of 
 the Moon to San Francisco’s Presidio Theatre for two exclusive screening
 s on October 1 and 2\, 2026\, at 7:00 p.m. This unique experience features
  a live performance of the film’s Grateful Dead-inspired score by Terrap
 in Family Band with special guest Eric Krasno\, followed by a standalone s
 econd set of music. Combining cutting-edge night cinematography with impro
 visational energy\, the event explores the connections between sport\, nat
 ure\, and human consciousness.\n\n$44.00\n\nTickets: https://www.presidiot
 heatre.org/show-details/mountains-of-the-moon\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
 p.com/mountains-moon-live-film-music-experience/\nSource: Funcheap SF
