BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chronovisor
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17872545@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:An armchair mystery in which the life of a reclusive academic 
 collides with the story of a clandestine technology that can photograph th
 e past.\n\nWhile writing a monograph on historical theories of memory\, B
 éatrice (Anne Laure Sellier)\, a respected academic\, becomes beguiled by
  the allegedly true story of the Chronovisor\, an occult device said to re
 produce visuals from any point in history on a TV screen. Her obsession wi
 th the mysterious machine drags her from her Upper East Side apartment thr
 ough the depths of New York City’s hidden libraries\, to the edge of a b
 reakthrough.\n\n“A riveting enigma of a brainteaser. One of the year’s
  most bewitching debuts.” — Ryan Lattanzio\, IndieWire\n\n“Astonishi
 ngly original. Enrapturing. A true story of paranormal intrigue.” — Jo
 rdan Cronk\, Film Comment “\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 39m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDire
 ctor\n\nJack Auen and Kevin Walker\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nUSA\n\nL
 anguage\n\nEnglish\n\nFirst Showing\n\nOctober 2\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nF
 eatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22165?site
 Token=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/202
 6/10/5/chronovisor-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
