DESCRIPTION:A Gialloween classic returns!\n\nWhen Carol (giallo superstar 
 Florinda Bolkan\, Footprints on the Moon\, Don’t Torture a Duckling) beg
 ins to have feverish\, erotic nightmares about her uninhibited neighbor Ju
 lia (Anita Strindberg\, likewise a Gialloween veteran)\, we’re immediate
 ly tossed into a labyrinth of sex\, drugs\, and gore-soaked murder. A ligh
 tning rod of left-field psychedelia from Italian horror maestro Lucio Fulc
 i (The Beyond\, Zombie)\, this dreamy giallo features a score by Ennio Mor
 ricone (The Good\, The Bad\, and The Ugly\, among others) and animatronic 
 props from F/X wizard Carlo Rambaldi (E.T.). Rimbaldi’s effects were so 
 lurid and realistic that he was called to testify in court on Fulci’s be
 half\, saving the director from a two-year stint in prison on charges of o
 bscenity. Bellissimo!\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 44m\n\nYear\n\n1971\n\nDirector\n\n
 Lucio Fulci\n\nFormat\n\nDigital\n\nCountry\n\nItaly\n\nLanguage\n\nItalia
