DESCRIPTION:SPARK Social SFMission Bay Harvest Festival Returns!\nSaturday
 \, October 17\, 2026 | 4PM–7PM\nOutdoor Movie Begins at 7PM\nSPARK Socia
 l SF | 601 Mission Bay Blvd North\, San Francisco\, CA\nFree Admission | E
 veryone Welcome\nCalling all Mission Bay residents! The Mission Bay Harves
 t Festival is back at SPARK Social for an afternoon of fall fun\, communit
 y\, and seasonal festivities.\n\nBring the family\, meet your neighbors\, 
 enjoy live music\, visit the petting zoo\, pick out a pumpkin\, and gather
  around the fire pit for free s’mores.\nFestival Highlights:\nPumpkin Pa
 tch\nPick out a pumpkin and get into the fall spirit. Pumpkins available w
 hile supplies last.\nPetting Zoo\nMeet adorable farm animals and enjoy a f
 un afternoon for the whole family.\nLive Band\nEnjoy live music while you 
 grab food\, relax\, and celebrate the season with your neighbors.\nMeet Yo
 ur Neighbors\nConnect with fellow Mission Bay residents and enjoy a commun
 ity gathering area.\nFree S’mores\nGather around the fire pit\, roast ma
 rshmallows\, and make your own s’mores. Available while supplies last.\n
 Food Trucks\nGrab dinner\, snacks\, and treats from SPARK Social’s food 
 trucks.\nOutdoor Movie Night\nStay after the festival for an outdoor scree
 ning of Hocus Pocus under the stars. Bring a blanket\, get cozy\, and enjo
 y a movie with family\, friends\, and neighbors.\nFestival: 4PM–7PM\nMov
 ie: 7PM\nCome celebrate fall with your Mission Bay community\, then stay f
 or the movie!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://MissionBayHF.eventbrite.com/?aff
