SUMMARY:Media Meltdown presents: Cemetery Man
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17872297@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:DELLAMORTE DELLAMORE: CEMETERY MAN (1994)\n\nId give my life t
 o be dead From director Michele Soavi (The Church\, Stage Fright) comes a 
 macabre masterpiece\, 1994s CEMETERY MAN\, also known aptly as DELLAMORTE 
 DELLAMORE (Of Death\, Of Love). This Italian-French-German co-production s
 tars British actor Rupert Everett (My Best Friends Wedding) as Franceso De
 llamorte\, a graveyard keeper tasked with putting the dead that rise each 
 night. Despite his gristly job\, Dellamorte is a romantic at heart. But is
  he free to find love\, or is fate bound to something far darker? And what
  does the Angel of Death have to do with all of it? Inspired by Tziano Scl
 avis novel Dellamorte Dellamore and his comic character Dylan Dog (who was
  visually based on Everett)\, this film is equal parts scary\, comedic\, a
 nd sexy\, with surprising surreal and philosophical developments as the pl
 ot develops. A must see film\, straight from the cold expanse of Hell to r
 ing in Halloween!\n\nMEDIA MELTDOWN MOVIE MADHOUSE\n\nGender jesters Piran
 ha Psychotronica and Kafka X bring you a new experience in cinematic depra
 vity Media Meltdown Movie Madhouse! Prepare yourself to enter into a world
  of face-flaying forgotten and forsaken films Made-for-TV\, Direct-to-Vide
 o\, VCR games\, underground cinema\, and more wiley weirdness than your mi
 nds can handle! In a world dominated by AI\, CGI\, mega streaming platform
 s\, and cinematic universes\, Media Meltdown celebrates the amateur\, the 
 low-budget\, the handmade\, the experimental\, and the weird!...\n\nTicket
 s: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/19950?siteToken=d2atbcege5k
 nqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/18/media-mel
 tdown-presents-cemetery-man-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34566181/a39211f7-37d4-438c-a3ab-6ed5cc43e5c3.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Cinema SF\, 2200 Clement Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94121 \, San
  Francisco\, CA\, 94117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/18/media-meltdown-presents-cemeter
 y-man-tickets
END:VEVENT
