DESCRIPTION:Professor Seagull's SmartshopCatch a free screening of the cul
 t grindhouse horror film I Drink Your Blood in North Beach.\nA group of Sa
 tanic hippies rolls into a small town and encounters a revenge plot involv
 ing rabies-infected meat pies\, setting off an increasingly deranged chain
  of events. Released in the early ’70s\, the film is a wild mix of explo
 itation horror\, psychedelic counterculture and black comedy.\nPart of the
  Psychedelic Film Series at Live Worms / Church of Mother Gong.\n\nFree\n\
 nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1989050825563?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDe
 tails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-cult-grandhourse-horror-film-screening
