 r plaza board. Snap a pic at our photo op and explore our other movie-them
 ed activities! The movie will begin at 1PM.Make sure to bring something wa
 rm as the weather can get a little chilly!Parking is now available seven d
 ays a week at the Chase Center Garage (CCG) located at 99 Warriors Way. Vi
 sit our parking page for more details.Space is limited to first-come\, fir
