SUMMARY:2026 Dance Film Fest: Free “Leap” Screening + Onstage Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T163000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638797@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Film still from "Leap!"\n\n2026 San Francisco Dance Film Festi
 val presents:\n\nLeap!\n\nA runaway hit with families at last year’s fes
 tival\, Leap! is back by popular demand!\n\nSunday\, November 8 at 1:30PM\
 nBrava Theater\nSuggested Donation: $10-15\n\nREGISTER TODAY\n\nBring the 
 whole family for a free screening of the animated feature film Leap!\, a h
 eartwarming adventure about courage\, friendship\, and following your drea
 ms. Set in 19th-century Paris\, the story follows Félicie\, a spirited or
 phan determined to become a ballerina\, and her best friend Victor\, an as
 piring inventor. Together they escape their orphanage and chase their pass
 ions in the City of Lights\, where Félicie must summon all her determinat
 ion to pursue the role of a lifetime at the Paris Opera Ballet.\nPerfect f
 or aspiring young artists\, this event will include an introduction by San
  Francisco Ballet Principal Dancer Dores André and a short opportunity fo
 r participants to dance onstage after the screening.\nAdmission is free\, 
 with a suggested donation of $10/child and $15/adult. Registration is requ
 ired.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/l
 eap/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-dance-film-fest-free-leap-scre
 ening-onstage-dance-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Leap_s
 tereo-downmix_ProRes.01_08_25_02.Still001.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Brava Theater\, 2781 24th St\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-dance-film-fest-free-leap-screening-onsta
 ge-dance-sf/
END:VEVENT
